# Assembled by copier from github/gitignore, the collection behind GitHub's
# own "add .gitignore" control. The template repository keeps upstream's
# files unedited, fetched by vendir at the commit its vendir.lock.yml records,
# and which of them apply follows the answers in .copier-answers.yml. Editor
# and operating system byproducts are absent on purpose: upstream keeps those
# under Global/ for a user's own core.excludesFile. A path only this
# repository produces is the gitignore_own answer, rendered at the end, so
# nothing in this file is written by hand.

# vale's StylesPath, which .vale.ini sets and the sync hook fills on every
# repository whatever its languages; the Python and C++ blocks below name the
# same directory, the others do not.
.cache/
